<00:00:00.098>But <00:00:00.163>I <00:00:00.217>saw <00:00:00.402>something <00:00:00.663>she <00:00:00.793>could <00:00:00.924>not. <00:00:01.598>One <00:00:01.804>winter <00:00:02.076>morning, <00:00:02.641>the <00:00:02.717>ground <00:00:03.033>around <00:00:03.337>me <00:00:03.467>was <00:00:03.609>white. <00:00:04.304>A <00:00:04.380>thin <00:00:04.685>coat <00:00:04.924>of <00:00:05.011>frost <00:00:05.435>had <00:00:05.554>formed <00:00:05.924>on <00:00:06.000>the <00:00:06.065>rocks. <00:00:06.891>Water <00:00:07.163>ice, <00:00:07.674>on <00:00:07.815>Mars, <00:00:08.489>right <00:00:08.630>in <00:00:08.707>front <00:00:08.870>of <00:00:08.913>my <00:00:09.033>cameras.

